From f9da8926474785c7a86e27f5a799fdbd8b2ab9c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ed Schofield <ed@aicharmers.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:39:36 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] drm/amd/display: Identify the internal iMac tile pair

Map the internal pair only on iMac20,1 systems with the expected PCI
identity and physical wiring.

Read the register that enables the companion before writing it, and
return AUX errors to the caller. Re-arm only after the primary
successfully enters D0. Keep the original handling for unmapped links,
synchronous training and failed power writes.

Signed-off-by: Ed Schofield <ed@aicharmers.com>
